      "Title": "EventHook.Hooks.WindowHookEx",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"obj/api/EventHook.Hooks.WindowHookEx.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Track events across all windows. Call <xref href=\"EventHook.Hooks.WindowHookEx.Start\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> before events fire.\nUnlike factory watchers, this type is not installed on <xref href=\"EventHook.EventHookFactory\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>'s pump:\n<xref href=\"EventHook.Hooks.WindowHookEx.Start\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> must run on a thread that already pumps messages (your UI thread).</p>\n"
