      "Title": "EventHook.HotkeyWatcher",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"obj/api/EventHook.HotkeyWatcher.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Global hotkey watcher using RegisterHotKey / WM_HOTKEY on the shared message pump.\n<xref href=\"EventHook.HotkeyWatcher.Start\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> succeeds only after the factory pump is up; <xref href=\"EventHook.HotkeyWatcher.IsRunning\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> does not\nmean a host-provided HWND is dispatching <code>WM_HOTKEY</code> — that window must pump those messages.</p>\n"
